<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <data>
        <record id="scm_policy_page" model="website.page">
            <field name="name">SCM Policy</field>
            <field name="type">qweb</field>
            <field name="url">/scm-policy</field>
            <field name="website_indexed" eval="True"/>
            <field name="is_published">True</field>
            <field name="key">website.scm-policy</field>
            <field name="arch" type="xml">
                <t t-name="website.scm-policy">
                    <t t-call="website.layout">
                        <div id="wrap" class="oe_structure oe_empty">
                            <section
                                    class="s_title parallax s_parallax_is_fixed bg-black-50 o_colored_level pt40 pb40 s_custom_snippet"
                                    data-vcss="001" data-snippet="s_title" data-scroll-background-ratio="1"
                                    style="background-image: none;" data-name="Page Header Title">
                                <span class="s_parallax_bg oe_img_bg o_bg_img_center o_bg_img_origin_border_box"
                                      style="background-image: url('/custom_website_design/static/src/image/banner_jpc_1.jpg'); background-position: 50% 0px;"
                                      data-mimetype="image/jpeg" data-resize-width="1920"/>
                                <div class="o_we_bg_filter bg-black-75"/>
                                <div class="container">
                                    <h1>
                                        <span style="font-size: 36px;">Supply Chain Management</span>
                                    </h1>
                                    <p>Transparent. Accountable. Inclusive. JPC's Approach to Fair and Competitive
                                        Procurement.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </section>
                            <section class="s_text_block pt40 pb40 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block"
                                     data-name="Text" style="background-image: none;">
                                <div class="container s_allow_columns">
                                    <h2>
                                        <span style="font-size: 36px;">
                                            <font style="color: rgb(255, 156, 0);">Overview:&amp;nbsp;</font>
                                            <strong>
                                                <font class="text-o-color-1">Building an Ethical and Competitive Supply
                                                    Chain
                                                </font>
                                            </strong>
                                        </span>
                                    </h2>
                                    <p>At the City of Joburg Property Company (JPC), our Supply Chain Management (SCM)
                                        Policy reflects a
                                        commitment to governance excellence, fairness, and economic transformation. As a
                                        municipal
                                        entity, our procurement activities are guided by the Municipal Finance
                                        Management Act (MFMA) and
                                        the Preferential Procurement Policy Framework Act (PPPFA), ensuring that public
                                        resources are
                                        used effectively and equitably.
                                    </p>
                                    <p>Our policy supports service delivery by facilitating procurement that is
                                        cost-effective,
                                        competitive, and aligned with national transformation goals.
                                    </p>
                                    <h3>
                                        <span style="font-size: 24px;">
                                            <font style="color: rgb(255, 156, 0);">Key Objectives</font>
                                            <font class="text-o-color-1">&amp;nbsp;of the SCM Policy</font>
                                        </span>
                                    </h3>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Promote transparency and accountability in all procurement processes.</li>
                                        <li>Achieve value for money in the acquisition of goods and services.</li>
                                        <li>Support broad-based economic empowerment, with a focus on local SMMEs.</li>
                                        <li>Minimize risks of fraud, corruption, and irregular expenditure through
                                            strong governance.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>Ensure timely delivery of infrastructure and services that benefit
                                            Johannesburg residents.
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <h3>
                                        <span style="font-size: 24px;">
                                            <font class="text-o-color-1">Guiding Principles</font>
                                        </span>
                                    </h3>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Fairness and Equity – All bidders receive equal treatment, and opportunities
                                            are open and
                                            accessible.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>Competitiveness – Contracts are awarded based on value, quality, and
                                            impact.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>Transparency – Decisions are documented, reportable, and subject to
                                            review.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>Accountability – Officials are held responsible for procurement outcomes.
                                        </li>
                                        <li>Ethical Conduct – All engagements follow strict codes of integrity and
                                            honesty.
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <h3>
                                        <span style="font-size: 24px;">
                                            <font class="text-o-color-1">Why It Matters</font>
                                        </span>
                                    </h3>
                                    <p>Our supply chain is not just about procurement—it's a tool for economic
                                        empowerment, community
                                        upliftment, and sustainable growth. With the recent updates to national
                                        procurement regulations,
                                        including revised thresholds and preferential goals, JPC is enhancing its
                                        systems to better
                                        serve the people of Johannesburg.
                                    </p>
                                    <p>
                                        <a class="btn btn-secondary"
                                           href="/web/content/custom_website_design.SCM_Policy_2024?download=false"
                                           target="_blank" data-bs-original-title="" title="">&amp;nbsp;Download SCM
                                            Policy
                                        </a>
                                    </p>
                                    <p>
                                        <br/>
                                    </p>
                                    <p>

                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </section>
                        </div>
                    </t>
                </t>
            </field>
        </record>

        <record id="csd_registration_page" model="website.page">
            <field name="name">CSD Registration</field>
            <field name="type">qweb</field>
            <field name="url">/csd-registration</field>
            <field name="website_indexed" eval="True"/>
            <field name="is_published">True</field>
            <field name="key">website.csd-registration</field>
            <field name="arch" type="xml">
                <t t-name="website.csd-registration">
                    <t t-call="website.layout">
                        <div id="wrap" class="oe_structure oe_empty">
                            <section
                                    class="s_title parallax s_parallax_is_fixed bg-black-50 o_colored_level pt40 pb40 s_custom_snippet"
                                    data-vcss="001" data-snippet="s_title" data-scroll-background-ratio="1"
                                    style="background-image: none;" data-name="Page Header Title">
                                <span class="s_parallax_bg oe_img_bg o_bg_img_center o_bg_img_origin_border_box"
                                      style="background-image: url('/custom_website_design/static/src/image/banner_jpc_1.jpg'); background-position: 50% 0px;"
                                      data-mimetype="image/jpeg" data-resize-width="1920"/>
                                <div class="o_we_bg_filter bg-black-75"/>
                                <div class="container">
                                    <h1>
                                        <span style="font-size: 36px;">Central Supplier Database (CSD)</span>
                                    </h1>
                                    <p>Register Today on the CSD to Access Procurement Opportunities.</p>
                                </div>
                            </section>
                            <section class="s_text_block pt40 pb40 o_colored_level" data-snippet="s_text_block"
                                     data-name="Text" style="background-image: none;">
                                <div class="container s_allow_columns">
                                    <h2>
                                        <span style="font-size: 36px;">
                                            <font style="color: rgb(255, 156, 0);">Empowering Local Suppliers</font>
                                            <strong>
                                                <font style="color: rgb(255, 156, 0);">&amp;nbsp;</font>
                                                <font class="text-o-color-1">Through Transparent Registration</font>
                                            </strong>
                                        </span>
                                    </h2>
                                    <p>If you're a business or individual interested in doing business with the City of
                                        Joburg Property
                                        Company (JPC), the first step is registering on the National Treasury’s Central
                                        Supplier
                                        Database (CSD). This is a mandatory requirement for all suppliers to be eligible
                                        for procurement
                                        opportunities across government entities in South Africa.
                                    </p>
                                    <p>By registering, you join a credible network of suppliers considered for
                                        contracts, tenders, and
                                        procurement projects issued by JPC and other organs of state.
                                    </p>
                                    <h3>
                                        <span style="font-size: 24px;">
                                            <strong>
                                                <font class="text-o-color-1">
                                                    <span style="font-weight: normal;">Why Register&amp;nbsp;on the
                                                        CSD?
                                                    </span>
                                                </font>
                                            </strong>
                                        </span>
                                    </h3>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Mandatory for all JPC procurement</li>
                                        <li>Ensures compliance with public procurement laws</li>
                                        <li>Streamlines verification of tax clearance, BBBEE, and company registration
                                        </li>
                                        <li>Connects your business to opportunities across all spheres of government
                                        </li>
                                        <li>Free and fully online registration</li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <h3>
                                        <span style="font-size: 24px;">
                                            <font class="text-o-color-1">Requirements for&amp;nbsp;</font>
                                            <strong>
                                                <font class="text-o-color-1">CSD Registration</font>
                                            </strong>
                                        </span>
                                    </h3>
                                    <p>Before registering, make sure you have the following:</p>
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>A valid South African ID or company registration number</li>
                                        <li>SARS tax reference number</li>
                                        <li>Bank account confirmation letter</li>
                                        <li>BBBEE certificate or sworn affidavit (if applicable)</li>
                                        <li>Proof of address</li>
                                        <li>VAT registration number (if registered)</li>
                                    </ul>
                                    <h3>
                                        <span style="font-size: 24px;">
                                            <font class="text-o-color-1">How to Register on the CSD</font>
                                        </span>
                                    </h3>
                                    <p>Visit the National Treasury CSD Portal</p>
                                    <p>→&amp;nbsp;
                                        <a href="https://secure.csd.gov.za/" target="_blank">https://secure.csd.gov.za
                                        </a>
                                    </p>
                                    <ol>
                                        <li><strong>Create a user profile</strong>&amp;nbsp;- Complete the required
                                            personal or business
                                            details.
                                        </li>
                                        <li><strong>Add your business and banking information</strong>&amp;nbsp;- The
                                            system will verify
                                            your data with SARS, CIPC, and your bank.
                                        </li>
                                        <li><strong>Upload supporting documents</strong>&amp;nbsp;- Ensure all documents
                                            are clear and
                                            up to date.
                                        </li>
                                        <li><strong>Get your unique CSD supplier number</strong>&amp;nbsp;- You will
                                            receive a MAAA
                                            reference number upon successful registration.
                                        </li>
                                    </ol>
                                    <h3>
                                        <span style="font-size: 24px;">
                                            <font class="text-o-color-1">Already Registered?&amp;nbsp;Update Your CSD
                                                Profile
                                            </font>
                                        </span>
                                    </h3>
                                    <p>It is your responsibility to ensure your CSD profile remains&amp;nbsp;<strong>
                                        active and
                                        accurate</strong>. Suppliers with expired or incomplete details will not be
                                        considered for
                                        procurement opportunities.
                                    </p>
                                    <p>

                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </section>
                        </div>
                    </t>
                </t>
            </field>
        </record>

    </data>
</odoo>
